  "worded": [
    {
      "tag": "S13",
      "passage": "PR002",
      "start": 1277,
      "end": 1349,
      "text": "Turning to guidance, we are raising our fiscal 2026 financial guidance. ",
      "p": 0.9612329673858953
    },
    {
      "tag": "S14",
      "passage": "PR002",
      "start": 1349,
      "end": 1464,
      "text": "We expect our revenue to be in the range of $11.21 billion to $11.24 billion, a total growth rate of 8.4% to 8.7%. ",
      "p": 0.8847811090233757
    },
    {
      "tag": "S15",
      "passage": "PR002",
      "start": 1464,
      "end": 1566,
      "text": "We expect adjusted diluted EPS to be in the range of $4.86 to $4.90, a growth rate of 10.5% to 11.4%. ",
      "p": 0.7900172472000122
    },
    {
      "tag": "S16",
      "passage": "PR002",
      "start": 1566,
      "end": 1676,
      "text": "The adjusted EPS guide does not include the impact of non-recurring transaction expenses related to Unifirst. ",
      "p": 0.9665452693917562
    },
    {
      "tag": "S50",
      "passage": "PR003",
      "start": 3240,
      "end": 3334,
      "text": "As a reminder, we anticipate that transaction will close in the second half of calendar 2026. ",
      "p": 0.7446378469467163
    },
    {
      "tag": "S65",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 1462,
      "end": 1611,
      "text": "With leverage expected to be about 1.5 times debt to EBITDA at closing, we maintain flexibility for deploying capital across each of our priorities. ",
      "p": 0.6711690225848846
    },
    {
      "tag": "S67",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 1763,
      "end": 1845,
      "text": "Earlier, Todd provided our updated guidance for the remainder of the fiscal year. ",
      "p": 0.3994633913360005
    },
    {
      "tag": "S68",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 1845,
      "end": 1901,
      "text": "In addition, please note the following in the guidance. ",
      "p": 0.5882508158683777
    },
    {
      "tag": "S69",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 1901,
      "end": 1996,
      "text": "Both fiscal 2025 and fiscal 2026 have the same number of workdays for the year and by quarter. ",
      "p": 0.7446380257606506
    },
    {
      "tag": "S70",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 1996,
      "end": 2050,
      "text": "Our guidance does not assume any future acquisitions. ",
      "p": 0.9711514639917621
    },
    {
      "tag": "S71",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 2050,
      "end": 2390,
      "text": "Our guidance assumes a constant foreign currency exchange rate the fiscal 2026 net interest expense of approximately $101 million, a fiscal 2026 effective tax rate of 20%, which is the same compared to our fiscal 2025, and the guide does not include the impact of any future share buybacks or significant economic disruptions or downturns. ",
      "p": 0.9370868732252204
    },
    {
      "tag": "S73",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 2493,
      "end": 2645,
      "text": "While the deal is expected to close in the second half of calendar 2026, we expect to incur non-recurring transaction costs related to the acquisition. ",
      "p": 0.8623154163360596
    },
    {
      "tag": "S74",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 2645,
      "end": 2749,
      "text": "The adjusted diluted earnings per share guide excludes the estimated impact of these transaction costs. ",
      "p": 0.9738739277999688
    },
    {
      "tag": "S75",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 2749,
      "end": 2904,
      "text": "Transaction costs expected to be incurred during fiscal 2026 are estimated to have an impact on diluted earnings per share in the range of $0.03 to $0.04. ",
      "p": 0.8561522023723186
    },
    {
      "tag": "S76",
      "passage": "PR004",
      "start": 2904,
      "end": 3088,
      "text": "In addition, beginning with the fourth quarter, we will break these costs out on our income statement as a separate line item to provide visibility to these transaction related costs. ",
      "p": 0.5758538074536977
    },
    {
      "tag": "S88",
      "passage": "QA000",
      "start": 684,
      "end": 802,
      "text": "The estimate that we provided of that three to four cents is related to the fourth quarter and the fiscal year guide. ",
      "p": 0.8739760052260162
    },
    {
      "tag": "S89",
      "passage": "QA000",
      "start": 802,
      "end": 854,
      "text": "Any costs that were incurred in Q3 were immaterial. ",
      "p": 0.44921304436883197
    },
    {
      "tag": "S104",
      "passage": "QA001",
      "start": 652,
      "end": 720,
      "text": "You know, certainly the increase in gas prices will have an impact. ",
      "p": 0.5633608530950293
    },
    {
      "tag": "S108",
      "passage": "QA001",
      "start": 1157,
      "end": 1248,
      "text": "You know, so yes, it has an impact, but not something that we feel that we can't overcome. ",
      "p": 0.5
    },
    {
      "tag": "S109",
      "passage": "QA001",
      "start": 1248,
      "end": 1291,
      "text": "And we have contemplated this in our guide.",
      "p": 0.9370868732252204
    },
    {
      "tag": "S112",
      "passage": "QA003",
      "start": 40,
      "end": 170,
      "text": "And then going back to an earlier point on fuel, you mentioned that – fuel expectations are contemplated in your full year guide. ",
      "p": 0.46185219287872314
    },
    {
      "tag": "S116",
      "passage": "QA003",
      "start": 489,
      "end": 563,
      "text": "And our guide includes our best estimate of the increase in energy costs. ",
      "p": 0.9551163386934722
    },
    {
      "tag": "S123",
      "passage": "QA003",
      "start": 944,
      "end": 1056,
      "text": "That being said, we've got to contemplate it in an increased level of gas prices at the pump into our guidance. ",
      "p": 0.9340146153708433
    },
    {
      "tag": "S124",
      "passage": "QA003",
      "start": 1056,
      "end": 1123,
      "text": "And as far as how we handle that, we do not have a fuel surcharge. ",
      "p": 0.3288309774151153
    },
    {
      "tag": "S141",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 603,
      "end": 705,
      "text": "And if we start to think about our growth formula and what we're attempting to achieve every quarter. ",
      "p": 0.2960113286972046
    },
    {
      "tag": "S142",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 705,
      "end": 785,
      "text": "You know, we do like to target that mid to high single-digit total growth rate. ",
      "p": 0.7900172472000122
    },
    {
      "tag": "S143",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 785,
      "end": 907,
      "text": "As an organization, the major contributors to that growth, as you correctly pointed out, is our new business acquisition. ",
      "p": 0.4117491841316223
    },
    {
      "tag": "S144",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 907,
      "end": 1124,
      "text": "And a reminder, you know, two-thirds of that new business acquisition comes with that no-programmer or do-it-yourself or space, and that continues to perform very well for us, and we really like the trend line there. ",
      "p": 0.34017495334669806
    },
    {
      "tag": "S145",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 1124,
      "end": 1258,
      "text": "Retention levels for us has stayed around that steady, that 95% rate, and we are really comfortable with where that is at this point. ",
      "p": 0.3288309774151153
    },
    {
      "tag": "S146",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 1258,
      "end": 1352,
      "text": "Pricing is at our historical levels, which we've considerably said is in that 2% to 3% range. ",
      "p": 0.4117491841316223
    },
    {
      "tag": "S147",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 1352,
      "end": 1539,
      "text": "And then the remainder of the growth, if you kind of put all those together, you know, you start with a negative five, you add in two percent for pricing and you want to get up to eight. ",
      "p": 0.5381475526646509
    },
    {
      "tag": "S148",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 1539,
      "end": 1576,
      "text": "The majority of that's new business. ",
      "p": 0.2752214290135673
    },
    {
      "tag": "S156",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 2176,
      "end": 2251,
      "text": "So I would say new business and cross-sell slightly continuing to improve. ",
      "p": 0.5127378549355908
    },
    {
      "tag": "S157",
      "passage": "QA006",
      "start": 2251,
      "end": 2305,
      "text": "and the others right where we're expecting them to be.",
      "p": 0.26517297417956437
    },
    {
      "tag": "S167",
      "passage": "QA016",
      "start": 486,
      "end": 588,
      "text": "And I appreciate you pointing it out because the comparative for Q4 on revenue growth is significant. ",
      "p": 0.3752811141228344
    },
    {
      "tag": "S170",
      "passage": "QA016",
      "start": 664,
      "end": 744,
      "text": "And we did have some one-time benefits, specifically in our first aid business. ",
      "p": 0.29601114988327026
    },
    {
      "tag": "S172",
      "passage": "QA016",
      "start": 775,
      "end": 818,
      "text": "We certainly do not anticipate that again. ",
      "p": 0.8142577056365522
    },
    {
      "tag": "S174",
      "passage": "QA016",
      "start": 872,
      "end": 976,
      "text": "In first aid, we had an increase in the training business that helped us as it relates to AED training. ",
      "p": 0.29601114988327026
    },
    {
      "tag": "S175",
      "passage": "QA016",
      "start": 976,
      "end": 1062,
      "text": "So that was a spike that we, again, we don't think is going to occur at those levels. ",
      "p": 0.6247191019272537
    },
    {
      "tag": "S177",
      "passage": "QA016",
      "start": 1156,
      "end": 1249,
      "text": "So, yeah, hopefully that gives you a little bit of color around the tough comparative in Q4.\n",
